title: A log shows what was asked; only the view snapshots show a buffer, and only its last exchange.
pid: 9c696930-a7dd-4c74-af54-0aa0faa866ae
body: |2-
  Only each request's header line is logged, not the response or the saved buffer.
  Since 2026-11-13 the run folder's 'views/' keeps each view's last sent text and
  last saved buffer; each exchange overwrites them, so what a buffer held before its
  last exchange is gone, and before that date nothing was kept.
  Log files never roll over, so they grow without bound ('TODO/problems.org' records
  a 133 MB server-to-user.log).
